## Purchase Order Review Flow

**File:** `PurchaseOrderReview/PurchaseOrderReview/PurchaseOrderReview.flow`

### What was built

```
Manual Trigger → [PO Review] → Approved? → PO Approved (End)
                                         ↘ PO Rejected (End)
```

| Node | Type | Role |
|---|---|---|
| **Manual Trigger** | `core.trigger.manual` | Someone kicks off the review by hand; passes in `poNumber`, `vendorName`, `totalAmount` as inputs |
| **PO Review** | `uipath.human-in-the-loop.quick-form` | Reviewer sees PO Number, Vendor Name, Total Amount (read-only); can enter optional Notes; clicks **Approve** (primary) or **Reject** |
| **Approved?** | `core.logic.decision` | Checks `$vars.poReview1.status === "Approve"` |
| **PO Approved** | `core.control.end` | Happy path; surfaces the reviewer's notes as a flow output |
| **PO Rejected** | `core.control.end` | Rejection path; same notes output |

**Flow inputs** (passed when triggering manually): `poNumber` (string), `vendorName` (string), `totalAmount` (number)
**Flow output**: `reviewNotes` (string, optional) — available to any system that called this flow

